%N A401382 Numbers k such that {the largest divisor of sigma(k) coprime with k} is a prime, where sigma is the sum of divisors function.
%H A401382 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A401382/b401382.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A401382 <a href="/index/O#opnseqs">Index entries for sequences where odd perfect numbers must occur, if they exist at all</a>.
%F A401382 {k such that A010051(A401375(k)) = 1}.
%o A401382 (PARI) is_A401382(n) = { my(s=sigma(n)); fordiv(s,d,if(1==gcd(s/d,n), return(isprime(s/d)))); };
%Y A401382 Cf. A000203, A010051, A401375.
%Y A401382 Subsequence of A401381.
